#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/modules/quantum-mechanics/bells-inequality-with-qiskit/extracted-outputs/f4eddadc-834e-48e8-b190-dfc7727c2b79-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Sortie de la cellule de code précédente](/learning/images/modules/quantum-mechanics/bells-inequality-with-qiskit/extracted-outputs/f4eddadc-834e-48e8-b190-dfc7727c2b79-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
